From: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 14:36:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs: model providers and multiple subscription accounts

Carried on custom while the design is discussed on upstream issue #503;
see docs/providers.md. Drop it once upstream has an equivalent.

There was no page describing the providers: block, so the new config_dir
setting and the per-session provider choice had nowhere to live.

Add docs/providers.md with the provider kinds and defaults, how to keep
several Claude or Codex subscription accounts on one host and sign each
in, and how a session picks one in the web app or through the API,
including launch failures, sub-agent inheritance and agents that pin their
own credential. Link it from the agent spec's provider reference.

Signed-off-by: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
